The save: compute CRC (simple xor/sum — use a simple FNV or just checksum). Keep a simple 32-bit sum.

```c
static uint32_t wave_store_crc(const void *data, size_t len)
{
  const uint8_t *p = data;
  uint32_t crc = 0x811c9dc5u;
  size_t i;
  for (i = 0; i < len; i++)
    {
      crc ^= p[i];
      crc *= 0x01000193u;
    }
  return crc;
}
